Then open `http://localhost:8080/livez`, `/readyz`, or `/hello`.
`/livez` reports process liveness. `/readyz` reports serving readiness; this
starter has no external dependencies, so both probes succeed while the process
is serving. `/healthz` is a compatibility alias for `/readyz`.

Before production, configure OpenTelemetry/Prometheus exporters and review the
KPro production-readiness checklist.
